{
  "task_id": "disaster-D31-stated-date",
  "name": "Disaster D-31 -- stated dates v3 (82 cards: rounds 1-4 core, 5-6 optional)",
  "version": "2026-10-04",
  "id_field": "item_id",
  "hide_empty": true,
  "instructions": "Check the extracted date against the real event date. Read the FPP text, the extracted date and its quoted evidence, the evidence snippets; search only if they do not settle it. YES only if the stated date is the exact day the accident/disaster itself happened (first day for multi-day events) -- NOT a trial, sentence, inspection, anniversary or publication date. If not exact: NO, and ALWAYS type the true date (the loader scores +/-3 days and the treatment-window overlap from it). 'Unsure' if you cannot verify. The card label is the round: after each round, export and run the loader; it says whether to continue.",
  "instructions_by_variant": {
    "stated": "Check the extracted date against the real event date. Read the FPP text, the extracted date and its quoted evidence, the evidence snippets; search only if they do not settle it. YES only if the stated date is the exact day the accident/disaster itself happened (first day for multi-day events) -- NOT a trial, sentence, inspection, anniversary or publication date. If not exact: NO, and ALWAYS type the true date (the loader scores +/-3 days and the treatment-window overlap from it). 'Unsure' if you cannot verify. The card label is the round: after each round, export and run the loader; it says whether to continue.",
    "adjudicate": "Two candidate dates (A, B) for the same incident, from two different sources; you are not told which is which. Pick the day the incident itself happened (start day for multi-day events). 'Neither' + the true date if both are wrong. Search as needed."
  },
